* lna-a2-cascode-shunt: cascode topology with shunt peaking inductor for bandwidth extension.
C C4 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 n1
NMOS NM1 n1 n2 VSS VSS
C C1 n2 n3
PMOS PM1 n3 n4 VDD VDD
L L2 n4 n5
C C2 n5 VSS
C C3 n3 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n6
NMOS NM3 n6 n7 VSS VSS
R R2 n7 n1
PMOS PM2 n8 n9 VDD VDD
R R4 n8 VSS
R R5 n9 n4